        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVr4bg080SwKTguF8HXks9ZEqgWKT1Rz9aa_hSeVeOoepi3b99-JA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Cloé has mastered her craft. A true professional and the passion for her job shows in the amazing job she did. The precision and delicate blade cut I got was quite an experience. Can't wait for my next cut/shave. Highly recommended",
        "time": 1706914486,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ahmed Gaber",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112174340559121085373/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU-5z_Y38xKmNUEDum05Mv_0t5zzBkiIYB10mmMTjJy9_SuGfaz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I’ve been taking my son to Jen for a while now, and I couldn’t be happier with the experience! She is patient, skilled, and really know how to work with kids. My boys always leaves with a great haircut and a big smile. The atmosphere is welcoming, and the service is top-notch. Highly recommend for anyone looking for a great haircut for their child!",
        "time": 1739044692,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Karll Cloutier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104419059710301011700/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJI7ZIs0EaPyrHeKhYz_h5_him8lZjTEPXBtiGHLRQIXCoZBg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Jennifer is, hands down, the best hairstylist I’ve had in years.\nHer attention to detail, skill, and professionalism are unmatched—and worth every mile of the drive I make from the city every three weeks. She never disappoints. Always consistent, always on point. I absolutely recommend her to anyone looking for a top-tier haircut and experience.",
        "time": 1750463416,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "J Christopher Rigg",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118435041056419757883/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW8gcf9iuzyFjBevecPKwKgUY3n4jFjieQJEhO6JBMyNvLLrD4AuQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "It was great. While my car is being detailed next door At Le LUXE auto spa. I was getting a great hair cut and beard trim. By a very detailed oriented barber!!! It was a great pleasure will defenitly be back again!",
        "time": 1583171251,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Frederic Gagne",
